---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Squiggle from "../components/Squiggle.astro";
const updated = "September 2026";
---
<Base title="Now" description="What Shubham Goel is focused on right now.">
  <section class="wrap narrow head">
    <p class="eyebrow">Now</p>
    <h1>What I'm focused on<Squiggle width="min(13rem, 55%)" /></h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated {updated}. <a href="https://nownownow.com/about" class="body-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">What's a now page?</a></p>

    <ul class="now-list stack">
      <li>
        <strong>Interviewing.</strong> In loops with a few frontier labs and consumer-tech teams,
        mostly for multimodal and ranking roles, working out where I want to spend the next few
        years. If you're hiring in that space, <a href="mailto:shubhamgoel27@gmail.com" class="body-link">say hi</a>.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Going deep on post-training and evals.</strong> Mostly by building: training small
        vision-language models and the eval harnesses that keep them honest.
        <a href="/blog/curbcheck" class="body-link">curbcheck</a> is the current one. The question
        I keep circling is what makes an eval you can actually trust.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Making <a href="https://github.com/shubhamgoel27/say-yes-to-soup" class="body-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Say Yes to Soup</a>.</strong> A cozy, Pokémon-style browser RPG about walking
        the world's villages and letting culture arrive sideways: through soup, slang, and the
        small corrections people give you. No combat, no timers, nothing to lose.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Off the keyboard.</strong> New season, so watching too much Arsenal, still trying
        to stop shanking the ball at padel, and hosting poker night in San Jose.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .head { padding-top: var(--space-2xl); }
  .updated { margin-top: var(--space-xs); color: var(--ink-faint); font-size: 0.88rem; font-family: var(--font-mono); }
  .now-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin-top: var(--space-l); font-size: var(--step-0); }
  .now-list li {
    padding-left: var(--space-m);
    position: relative;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .now-list li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0.65em;
    width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 2px;
    background: var(--accent);
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }
  .now-list strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
  .now-list a { color: var(--accent-ink); }
</style>
